# File operations: a new folder and a new file, rename, move to the Trash and undo.
Output assets/readme/feature-files.gif
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Source assets/readme/tapes/lib/common.tape
Type "lazyfinder" Enter
Wait+Screen@20s /Favorites/
Show
Sleep 1s

Down
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "N"
Sleep 800ms
Type "Drafts"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "n"
Sleep 800ms
Type "ideas.txt"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "R"
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+U
Sleep 300ms
Type "plan.txt"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "d"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "u"
Sleep 1.8s

Type "q"
